    "text": "townline.org\nwebsite\nWinslow\nWinslow’s Adirondack chairs are gone\nBy Roland D. Hallee,\n9 hours ago“It’s a sad, sad situation. People love the chairs,” Winslow Parks and Recreation Director Amanda McCaslin said regretfully. The chairs she meant were the wooden Adirondack chairs that used to be in Fort Halifax Park, near the Kennebec River. Early in June, unknown people apparently threw them into the river.\n3",
